<title>UK: GOLF-U.S. INTO DUNHILL CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. INTO DUNHILL CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ST ANDREWS, Scotland 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States advanced to the final of the Dunhill Cup when they took a winning 2-0 lead over Sweden in the semifinals on Sunday.  </p>
<p>The final score of the tie was 2-1.</p>
<p>New Zealand beat South Africa 2-1 in the second semifinal.</p>
<p>The final was being played later on Sunday.</p>
